window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>USA Today Bestselling author, W.J. May, brings you the highly anticipated continuation of the bestselling YA/NA series about love, betrayal, magic and fantasy. You cannot hide from destiny. It will always find you.</p> <p>When Evie and her friends take an unexpected turn, they find themselves face to face with the last person they ever imagined they'd find, the very witch who delivered the fateful prophecy all those years ago. Relief is short-lived as the woman provides more questions than answers, setting them each down a path of discovery, but there's no telling if they'll like what they find. Danger lurks behind every corner. A journey home becomes a matter of life or death. The Dunes await but chaos is already upon, ripping the very fabric of the realm.</p> <p>Is there a way to stop it?</p> <p>Or has it always been a matter of fate? Be careful who you trust. Even the devil was once an angel. </p> <p>OMEGA QUEEN SERIES</p> <p>Discipline</p> <p>Bravery</p> <p>Courage</p> <p>Conquer</p> <p>Strength</p> <p>Validation</p> <p>Approval</p> <p>Blessing</p> <p>Balance</p> <p>Grievance</p> <p>Enchanted</p> <p>Gratified </p> <p>ORIGINAL SERIES:</p> <p>Queen's Alpha Series: </p> <p>Eternal</p> <p>Everlasting</p> <p>Unceasing</p> <p>Evermore</p> <p>Forever</p> <p>Boundless</p> <p>Prophecy</p> <p>Protected</p> <p>Foretelling</p> <p>Revelation</p> <p>Betrayal</p> <p>Resolved</p>"; 
